                    {
                        "sense_id": "27b8552c-a1f3-3517-9a76-1296025f2bad",
                        "entry_id": "51640bf9-8ae5-325b-9325-b0d98f1f8e34",
                        "glosses": [
                            "initial public offering (“首次公開募股”) 之首字母縮略詞。"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "form-of"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6e004174-3bcb-41a6-9e16-bd91984a9e27",
                                "sense_id": "27b8552c-a1f3-3517-9a76-1296025f2bad",
                                "text": "You just shrug when you change the site’s privacy settings overnight to capture lucrative personal information and make Facebook’s IPO one of the biggest in Silicon Valley.",
                                "translation": "你只是不以为意地耸耸肩，却在一夜之间更改了网站的隐私设置，收集大量极具商业价值的个人信息，并推动Facebook的首次公开募股成为硅谷最重大的上市事件之一。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c8ca032f-a44d-4b59-87c9-76cd56d824e4",
                                "sense_id": "27b8552c-a1f3-3517-9a76-1296025f2bad",
                                "text": "But AB InBev pulled the plug on a proposed IPO of its Asian business in Hong Kong earlier this month, citing tough market conditions.",
                                "translation": "但本月初，百威英博以市场环境艰难为由，叫停了其亚洲业务在香港的首次公开募股计划。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a2dc1e7f-cad6-45ce-9311-b94aae913881",
                                "sense_id": "27b8552c-a1f3-3517-9a76-1296025f2bad",
                                "text": "The paper points towards a broader shift from public to private financial markets where the winning tech firms with hectobillion-dollar-equity valuations may reject IPOs and stay privately-held while founders seek to retain total corporate control over AGI technologies.",
                                "translation": "该论文指出，金融市场正从公共市场向私人市场发生更广泛的转变，估值达数十亿美元的科技公司可能会拒绝首次公开募股，保持私有状态，而创始人则寻求对通用人工智能技术保持完全的公司控制权。"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8301f400-4613-3699-9ae0-75cf1f456d43",
